{"id": "DfPawYvnSLT", "title": "Video by vedastovikings", "description": "Born in armour no weapon could pierce. And his mother gave him to a river.\nऐसे कवच के साथ जन्मे, जिसे कोई शस्त्र भेद न सके... और माँ ने उन्हें नदी को सौंप दिया।\n\nA princess called the Sun with a sage's mantra and bore his son in golden armour. Unmarried and afraid, she set him adrift at night. A charioteer raised him. Years later, at the princes' tournament, he matched Arjuna feat for feat and was mocked for his birth, until Duryodhana made him a king. In the stands, one queen fainted. (Mahabharata, Adi Parva 1.111, 1.136-138; Vana Parva 3.305-307)\n\nThe Brother Who Never Knew, part 1 of 6. Part 2, Five Sons, is next.\n\nDid you know who she was? Tell me below 👇\n\n#mahabharat #mahabharata #karna #duryodhana #महाभारत", "channel": "vedastovikings", "uploader_id": "60997589521", "uploader": "Vedas to Vikings | Mythology films", "timestamp": 1793626258, "like_count": 2266, "comment_count": 23, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-17958584169037522a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 63.171, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOoCn_i52PwQGxgBRKe4bNMp5zo5RcJVzodttWTsYLenCV1_11OqOdsJ_Op6vQyA5piDHc0Z5vPE6LfYMRjkBogIaGjsMM5r8D4-_o.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=Adpn435IC2tbxGENjMR_A0BOL5OR0kzhYHTMqCM0Vkb1QVK8y8YcMltDR3YPT--HBkaL-_ozm22PTuQ81lWSK1-f&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=PDYTv910pxYQ7kNvwF-JYCX&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=0l-cjMTUvcPIJx19M41cSw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQEpqUnqZZPieRrYSaQbqUUwM